      "item_id": "universal-e5872ef79b00",
      "queued_at": "2026-10-07T17:08:33.964Z",
      "title": "AI boom brings financial and safety concerns into sharper focus",
      "summary": "Investors and policymakers at Singapore forums on October 7 discussed risks from rapid AI investment, including high valuations, heavy borrowing and concerns about autonomous systems. The discussion reflects a widening debate about whether expected returns and safeguards will keep pace with investment.",
      "why_it_matters": "If AI investment disappoints, losses could spread through markets and lenders; if deployment accelerates without adequate safeguards, the risks extend beyond finance. The overlap makes AI infrastructure both a technology and financial-stability issue.",
