      "title": "Weston family agrees to buy Boots in an $8.9 billion deal",
      "summary": "Wittington Investments, the Weston family holding company, agreed to acquire Boots and related businesses from Sycamore Partners and the Pessina family. The deal covers Boots’ UK and Ireland retail operations, opticians and No7 beauty brand, and is expected to close in 2027 subject to regulatory approval.",
